# The cloud workspace API is same-origin under /api/* — no configurable URL and
# no browser-held credentials. Sessions use the Worker's HttpOnly cookie.
#
# Optional integrations (see docs/prototype/integration-configuration.md):
#
# Email delivery (US-GAP-05/06) — configure ONE of:
#   EMAIL_PROVIDER         service binding to the deployed worker/emailProvider Worker
#   SEND_EMAIL             native Cloudflare Email Routing send binding
#   EMAIL_API_URL          transactional email API endpoint (email-provider Worker)
#   EMAIL_API_KEY          email API credential (wrangler secret put)
#   EMAIL_FROM             verified sender address (email-provider Worker)
#   EMAIL_FROM_NAME        sender display name (email-provider Worker)
#
# SharePoint / Microsoft Graph (US-GAP-25..28) — all required to enable:
#   SHAREPOINT_TENANT_ID       Microsoft Entra tenant id
#   SHAREPOINT_CLIENT_ID       app registration (client) id
#   SHAREPOINT_CLIENT_SECRET   client secret (wrangler secret put)
#   SHAREPOINT_SITE_HOSTNAME   e.g. contoso.sharepoint.com
#   SHAREPOINT_SITE_PATH       e.g. /sites/audit-test
#   SHAREPOINT_DRIVE_NAME      document library name (default: Documents)

